# Site file for the BETA host's caddy-crowdsec stack (docs/admin/beta.md):
# copy to <caddy stack>/config/sites/, then reload Caddy.
beta.play.pikdame.online {
	import common
	header X-Robots-Tag "noindex, nofollow"
	reverse_proxy pikdame-beta:8080 {
		# A Caddy reload must not drop running games.
		stream_close_delay 5m
	}
}
